'''Idi:N''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] introduced in [[Version 9.9 Update|Version 9.9]] and unlocked after clearing the [[Eldritch Forces/Invasion|Eldritch Forces Invasion]] which appears after beating all [[Stories of Legend]] sub-chapters on {{4c}} difficulty. As of [[Version 13.7 Update|Version 13.7]], clearing [[Uncanny Legends]] unlocks [[The Face of God/Invasion|The Face of God Invasion]], which allows her [[True Form]] to be unlocked once beaten. Her True Form replaces her [[Massive Damage]] ability with [[Insane Damage]] and gains [[Sage Slayer]], increased HP and [[Immune to Explosions|Explosion Immunity]].

