==Trivia==
*The name Idi may be derived from ''ID'', ''[[wiktionary:id#English|id]]'', ''[[wikipedia:Eden|Eden]]'', 遺伝 ''iden'' (genetic heredity), アイディア ''aidia'' (idea), アイディアル ''aidiaru'' (ideal), or アイディリック ''aidirikku'' (idyllic).
*The "N" in Idi:N's name may stand for 猫 ''neko'' (cat) or represent an unspecified or variable number.
*The "NX" in Idi:NX's name may stand for ''next'' (referring to how she is the next step in Idi:N's evolution line) or ''nexus'' (a connected group, like the [[Idi:Ne]]s in [[The Face of God/Invasion|The Face of God Invasion]]). The "X" could also represent a value that is not yet known or the Roman numeral for 10.
*Her gender is confirmed by the description of the ''Elder Annihilator'' [[Meow Medals|Meow Medal]]: "Defeat [[Idi:Re]] and clear her stage."
*Her evolution line follows a similar progression to [[Superfeline (Normal Cat)|Superfeline]], becoming larger and more fearsome, then shrinking and appearing more childlike, possibly referencing Nietzsche's [https://medium.com/@gerlynnhuang/a-camel-a-lion-and-a-child-what-nietzsche-wants-to-tell-us-about-the-meaningful-life-e1786dd6c83a three metamorphoses] towards freedom described in ''[[wikipedia:Thus Spoke Zarathustra: A Book for All and None|Thus Spoke Zarathustra: A Book for All and None]]''.
*Idi:NX was added in [[Version 13.7 Update|Version 13.7]] on September 26th, 2024, exactly 49 months after Idi:N was added ([[Version 9.9 Update|Version 9.9]] on August 26th, 2020). This length of time may be a reference to how 49 is the number of sub-chapters in [[Stories of Legend]] and [[Uncanny Legends]].
*She is the only Stories of Legend drop unit who doesn't increase the player's [[Enigma Stages|Enigma]] Level.
*She and [[Mecha-Bun (Special Cat)|Mecha-Bun]] are the only [[Stories of Legend]] drop units to have a 100% drop rate.
*Idi:NX is the first unit to be [[Immune to Explosions]].

